<!-- About Section -->
<section id="about" class="bg-base-100 my-10">
  <div class="container mx-auto px-4 md:max-w-2/3">
    <div class="text-center mb-16">
      <%- include('../components/section_title', { text: 'About ICCT-SD 2026' }) %>
      <p class="text-justify text-body">

        The International Conference on Intelligent Computational and Communication Technologies for Sustainable Development (ICCT-SD 2026) aims to bring together researchers, academicians, industry professionals, and policymakers to explore how emerging technologies can drive progress toward achieving the United Nations' Sustainable Development Goals (SDGs). The conference focuses on the intersection of intelligent computational methods, advanced communication technologies, and sustainable development, fostering collaboration and innovation in these critical areas.
        <br>
        The primary objective is to address global challenges related to physical and mental health, societal needs, conductive environment, and technological innovations in various fields by leveraging cutting-edge technologies like artificial intelligence, machine learning, Internet of Things (IoT), and big data analytics. Participants will discuss and present research findings, case studies, and best practices that demonstrate how these technologies can be applied to create sustainable solutions.
        <br>
        By providing a platform for knowledge exchange and networking, the conference aims to inspire actionable insights and partnerships that contribute to the global agenda of sustainable development. The ICCT-SD seeks to catalyze technological innovations that align with the SDGs, ensuring that technological advancements benefit society at large and contribute to a more equitable, sustainable future. This conference is focused on the advanced technologies like Artificial Intelligence and Machine Learning, Internet of Things (IoT) and Smart Systems, Big Data Analytics and Cloud Computing, Next-Generation Network and Communication Technologies, Security and Privacy, and other Contemporary Technologies and their contribution in the various United Nations' Sustainable Development Goals.

      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="gap-12 items-center my-16">

      <h3 class="text-h3 font-semibold text-secondary mb-6 font-montserrat text-center">Objectives</h3>
      <div class="grid gap-3">
        <% for(let i=0; i < objectives.length; i++) { %>
        <div class="p-3 bg-base-200 rounded-lg border-l-4 border-secondary/30">
          <p class="text-body font-semibold text-base-content/90 leading-relaxed">
            <%= objectives[i] %>
          </p>
        </div>
        <% } %>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- Important Links Section -->
<section class="py-10 bg-gradient-to-br from-base-200 to-base-100">
  <div class="container mx-auto px-4 md:max-w-2/3">
    <div class="text-center mb-6">
      <%- include('../components/section_title', { text: 'The City, Ludhiana.' }) %>
    </div>
    <!-- name of each tab group should be unique -->
    <div class="tabs tabs-xs md:tabs-md tabs-border w-full">
      <!-- Tab 1 -->
      <input type="radio" name="ludhiana_tabs" class="tab  ml-4" aria-label="About Ludhiana" checked="checked" />
      <div class="tab-content border-base-300 bg-base-100 p-10 space-y-4">
        <h2 class="text-h5 font-bold text-secondary">About Ludhiana</h2>
        <p class="leading-relaxed text-justify text-base-content/90 text-body">
          Ludhiana, often called the <strong>Manchester of India</strong>, is the
          largest city in Punjab and a major industrial hub of northern India. Known
          for its vibrant textile industry, hosiery exports, and entrepreneurial
          spirit, Ludhiana blends tradition with progress. Beyond its economic
          prowess, the city is rich in Punjabi culture — from lively folk dances and
          sumptuous cuisine to warm hospitality. The Sutlej River runs along its
          northern edge, offering a serene contrast to the city’s bustling life.
          Whether you’re walking through old bazaars, exploring Gurudwaras, or
          enjoying a glass of lassi at a roadside dhaba, Ludhiana promises an
          experience full of heart and energy.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Tab 2 -->
      <input type="radio" name="ludhiana_tabs" class="tab" aria-label="Gallery" />
      <div class="tab-content border-base-300 bg-base-100 p-10">
        <h2 class="text-h5 font-bold text-secondary mb-6">Gallery</h2>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-4">
          <% for( let index=0; index < ludhiana_images.length; index++ ) { %>
